# LICENSE

Mystery Flesh Pit National Park Archive Collection

This archive collection is released under the current licensing strategy as determined by the project maintainers.

All materials in this archive represent recovered authentic documentation from the now-defunct Mystery Flesh Pit National Park (2003-2007), presented as artifacts and ephemera without modification except for organizational cataloging and cross-reference verification.

Use of these materials is governed by the terms specified in the primary project LICENSE file. For details, see the LICENSE file in the repository root.

